   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Telling apart «mögen» and «gern»",
     "texto": [
      "In German there are two basic ways to say that you like something:",
      "1. **For nouns (things, food, people) → mögen:**",
      "It is a verb that is conjugated: **ich mag, du magst, er/sie/es mag, wir mögen, ihr mögt, sie/Sie mögen**.",
      "**Ich mag Käse.** (I like cheese).",
      "**Er mag keinen Fisch.** (He doesn't like fish).",
      "2. **For actions (verbs) → Verb + gern:**",
      "«mögen» isn't used in front of another verb; instead, the adverb **gern** comes after the conjugated verb:",
      "**Ich esse gern Reis.** (I like eating rice).",
      "**Wir essen gern Pizza.** (We like eating pizza).",
      "Negation of actions: **nicht gern** → **Ich trinke nicht gern Kaffee.** (I don't like drinking coffee).",
      "To express preference: the comparative of «gern» is **lieber** (more gladly, preferably) → **Ich trinke lieber Tee.** (I prefer to drink tea)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Likes and preferences in German",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Structure",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Example in German",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "English",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
     "filas": [
      [
       {
        "texto": "Nouns (things)",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "mögen + accusative",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Ich mag Obst.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "I like fruit.",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "Actions (verbs)",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "verb + gern",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Ich esse gern Reis.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "I like eating rice.",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "Negation with things",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "mögen + kein",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Er mag keinen Fisch.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "He doesn't like fish.",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "Negation with actions",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "verb + nicht gern",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Wir essen nicht gern Fleisch.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "We don't like eating meat.",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "Preference",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "verb + lieber",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Ich trinke lieber Saft.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "I prefer to drink juice.",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ]
     ],
